1
00:00:00,054 --> 00:00:03,784
(Leonard:)Oh. My cute little tushy strikes again.

2
00:00:06,227 --> 00:00:09,757
I'm serious. I've always had these plans.
I was gonna be in movies...

3
00:00:09,964 --> 00:00:12,664
(Penny:)...and live this glamorous life,
and anything less than that...

4
00:00:12,867 --> 00:00:16,527
(Penny:)...wasn't worth getting excited about.
- Those things can still happen.

5
00:00:16,771 --> 00:00:20,171
(Penny:)Obviously, it's gonna happen.
A psychic at a bachelorette party told me.

6
00:00:21,042 --> 00:00:25,312
(Penny:)Anyway, what I meant was
I shouldn't wait, you know?

7
00:00:25,513 --> 00:00:28,673
(Penny:)I've got you, I've got Sheldon...

8
00:00:28,883 --> 00:00:30,753
...and all these wonderful friends.

9
00:00:30,952 --> 00:00:32,942
(Penny:)My life is exciting right now.

10
00:00:34,489 --> 00:00:36,959
- That's a big deal.
- It is, isn't it?

11
00:00:40,561 --> 00:00:43,651
(Leonard:)So does that mean we get to do stuff
like talk about cool shows...

12
00:00:43,865 --> 00:00:47,995
(Leonard:)...or get dressed up in matching costumes
and go to Comic-Con?

13
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:52,160
(Penny:)Leonard, I had an epiphany, not a stroke.

14
00:00:56,177 --> 00:00:59,377
Amy, I must say, I was skeptical at first...

